<name>Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN]</name>
<para id="RM0000021WU009X" category="C" type-id="304MR" name-id="940AN-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2785</dtccode>
<dtcname>LIN communication malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000021WU009X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000C0W00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) performs LIN communication with the immobiliser code computer (ID code box), steering lock actuator (steering lock ECU) and instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU), and stores this code when it detects a communication malfunction between ECUs or an open or short in the LIN communication line. Also, when communication between the ECUs returns to normal, the DTC is cleared and stored as a past DTC.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>When replacing the smart key computer assembly (certification ECU), steering lock actuator (steering lock ECU) or immobiliser code computer (ID code box), refer to the registration procedure in the reference section.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</item>
</list1>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.93in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.33in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.83in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Trouble Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2785</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>LIN communication malfunction between ECUs, or open or short in communication line</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When LIN communication from the certification ECU is interrupted for a certain period of time or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Smart Key Computer Assembly</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Verification ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Instrument Panel Junction Block Assembly (Main Body ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Steering Lock Actuator</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Steering Lock ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Immobiliser Code ECU</ptxt>
<ptxt>(ID Code Box)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000021WU009X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000C0X00000">
